  m_Text: 'W     Move closer to see orders

    S      Return to the counter

    A
    / D     Turn left / right


    Hold left mouse to pick up an item.

    Keep
    holding + W / S / A / D to carry it.

    Release over a valid target to use
    it.


    Right click     Cancel and return item

    Esc     Back to the pause
    menu'
